<body>
    <h1>Feature Sheet - Change Audit Trail (aka User History)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide the necessary info of the said fea=
ture to prepare for Operations / Support Knowledge Transfer and client-faci=
ng resource documentation.</p>
    <p><strong>Document Owner: </strong>Product team</p>
    <p><strong>Target Audience: </strong>NBIN internal teams who want to un=
derstand the said feature to prepare client-facing resources or internal KT=
 wiki pages, or support clients. For example, L&amp;D, Product Support, Pro=
duct Activation, IT Production Support.&nbsp;</p>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p><strong>Table of Content</strong></p>
    <p>
     <style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
div.rbtoc1788183793819 {padding: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1788183793819 ul {margin-left: 0px;}
div.rbtoc1788183793819 li {margin-left: 0px;padding-left: 0px;}

/*]]>*/</style></p>
    <div class=3D"toc-macro rbtoc1788183793819">
     <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
      <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-KeyBenef=
its">Key Benefits</a></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-FeatureS=
cope">Feature Scope</a>
       <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
        <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-InScop=
e">In Scope</a></li>
        <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-OutofS=
cope">Out of Scope</a></li>
       </ul></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-Solution=
Overview">Solution Overview</a>
       <ul class=3D"toc-indentation">
        <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-Proces=
sView">Process View</a></li>
        <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-Featur=
eUseCases">Feature Use Cases</a></li>
       </ul></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-OpenRisk=
s&amp;KnownGaps">Open Risks &amp; Known Gaps</a></li>
      <li><a href=3D"#FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-Referenc=
eLinks&amp;Artifacts">Reference Links &amp; Artifacts</a></li>
     </ul>
    </div>
    <p></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>&nbsp;<span style=3D"font-size: 24.0px;letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Fea=
ture Summary</span></p>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>A concise description of the feature, focusing on&nbsp;<em>what ca=
pability exists</em> and <em>what business function it enables</em>. Avoid =
value propositions; be factual.</p>
      <p>Example: =E2=80=9CEmployee Access enables authenticated employees =
to view and interact with internal features based on assigned roles and per=
missions.=E2=80=9D</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">The&nbsp;</span><strong style=
=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Change Audit Trail</strong><span style=3D"lette=
r-spacing: 0.0px;"> (also referred to as </span><em style=3D"letter-spacing=
: 0.0px;">User History</em><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">) provide=
s a centralized, immutable record of all changes made to a user profile wit=
hin the Compass platform. It captures </span><em style=3D"letter-spacing: 0=
.0px;">who</em><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> made a change, </spa=
n><em style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">what</em><span style=3D"letter-spaci=
ng: 0.0px;"> was changed, </span><em style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">when<=
/em><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"> it occurred, and </span><em sty=
le=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">how</em><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;=
"> it was initiated (user action or system=E2=80=91driven), enabling intern=
al teams to quickly investigate access issues, validate provisioning decisi=
ons, and support governance and audit requirements. The feature is accessed=
 through the Users module and presents a chronological, human=E2=80=91reada=
ble view of profile updates, supporting troubleshooting, security reviews, =
and periodic access attestations.</span></p>
    <h1 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-KeyBenefits">Key=
 Benefits</h1>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe why we have prioritized this feature and who does it bene=
fit / what problem does it solve?</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><strong>1. Improved accountability &amp; traceability</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"06f9f0fd-f018-44b5-a142-1717be3c75c4">Provides a comp=
lete, immutable history of changes made to user profiles, answering&nbsp;<e=
m>who changed what, when, and how</em>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>2. Faster issue investigation &amp; support resolution</stro=
ng></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f9625191-5e82-4813-ac2b-2ac4592cda8e">Enables Product=
 Support, Activation, and Security teams to quickly diagnose access or conf=
iguration issues without manual log digging.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>3. Governance &amp; compliance readiness</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"5e3ff466-ac88-4ac1-8a44-38b379e1c72a">Supports intern=
al audits, access reviews, and certifications by retaining a standardized, =
reviewable change history.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>4. Reduced operational risk</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"cbdc5e3b-7187-4fff-bead-d8c0664eda29">Helps detect un=
intended or system=E2=80=91driven changes and differentiate them from user=
=E2=80=91initiated actions.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-FeatureScope">Fe=
ature Scope</h1>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Clearly define what the solution <strong>covers</strong> and <stro=
ng>does not cover</strong> to prevent incorrect assumptions by Ops and Supp=
ort teams.</p>
      <ul>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"7d69519a-99c8-4dc7-ab30-3f5ad6b5e2d1">In scope: supported systems, acc=
ess types, user populations</li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"7d9a4477-1e32-4ef9-89f1-a39ddc037d2f">Out of scope: unsupported roles,=
 environments, or edge scenarios</li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p>The Change Audit Trail captures and presents a chronological history=
 of changes applied to a user profile within the platform. It surfaces both=
 high=E2=80=91level summaries and detailed =E2=80=9Cbefore vs. after=E2=80=
=9D values for each change event, aligned to governance and troubleshooting=
 needs.</p>
    <h2 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-InScope">In Scop=
e</h2>
    <p>1. Tracking of <strong>user profile changes</strong> made via:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"6aa5cae6-882f-45ad-bdbb-acce90afca9c">User admin tool (UI)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"3cc2708c-5890-43f7-b9d4-ea57b10b6cdd">Bulk user updates</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"28ab3a1c-6245-4b9e-813e-6f000a148c64">System=E2=80=91initiated updates =
(e.g., firm or package=E2=80=91driven changes)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"62532ea5-e69e-4db5-9c1c-f9a30eeee11a">End=E2=80=91user preference chang=
es (e.g., preferred language toggles)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>2. Captured attributes per event:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"35d6ea20-2ae0-4956-b4ed-d1222f212c12">Changed field(s)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"199cef74-76a8-4ba1-8204-e58eeaf5d736">Previous value =E2=86=92 new valu=
e</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"bfc41d2b-e5d9-4ce8-978c-c7538745f2b6">Actor (user or system)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"fc8a862e-92fc-41e2-b50f-3db5b9b05b61">Date &amp; timestamp</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"7cb18cc6-7a4e-42ce-b55d-efd4e5055eac">Change source (UI, bulk action, s=
ystem)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>3. Immutable audit log (events cannot be edited or deleted)</p>
    <p>4. UI access via&nbsp;<strong>Users module =E2=86=92 User Details =
=E2=86=92 History</strong></p>
    <p>5. Retention of audit history for governance and certification needs=
, up to 18 months</p>
    <p>6. Filtering and readable presentation of complex or coded fields</p=
>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-OutofScope">Out =
of Scope</h2>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c4c95cc8-a2fd-4be1-8867-da2b1e3a7cfd">Editing, deleti=
ng, or correcting historical audit records</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"89d1c4d2-6e7c-40cc-9856-15e0695a8a57">External client=
 access to the audit trail (internal users only)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b3362c32-8ec0-47b8-9a0b-abb252075869">Audit trail for=
 non=E2=80=91user objects (e.g., firm settings, trades) unless explicitly d=
efined under a separate feature</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f5a8ae4a-0b58-451c-977c-2b1ce662539d">Advanced analyt=
ics or reporting on audit data (export, dashboards)</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-SolutionOverview=
">Solution Overview</h1>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>This section describes the solution end=E2=80=91to=E2=80=91end, co=
vering all feature use cases and the mechanisms by which they are implement=
ed, operated, and supported.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p>The Change Audit Trail leverages existing system event logs generate=
d during user profile updates. Each change event is persisted as an immutab=
le record and associated with the relevant user.<br>
      The UI presents:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"430b2340-aae1-4711-9354-1c93a46ac49b">A <strong>chronological event lis=
t</strong> (most recent first)</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"fcd328af-aaea-415b-a529-9f0d41ff8fc1">Expandable event rows showing det=
ailed field=E2=80=91level changes</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"2c12b62f-dbe1-4661-bc89-5f8ee0630a64">Clear attribution of changes to <=
strong>user vs. system</strong></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"d3d2fc9d-3af8-407c-88e7-46bef9db3eaf">Human=E2=80=91readable labels, wi=
th underlying values preserved for accuracy</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br>
      This approach establishes a reusable audit pattern that can be extend=
ed to other entities in the future.</p>
    <h2 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-ProcessView">Pro=
cess View</h2>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe the end-to-end process workflow or user journey maps to p=
rovide the context for the following feature use cases. Add a simple lifecy=
cle diagram narrative, if applicable.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:980=
px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"494957e3d6b7cc410afa383c792d44b0b1e5f3ce96b4674=
84dd01f008c2623c4" height=3D"57"></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 71.842%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 19.8925%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 19.4865%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 19.0806%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 19.2835%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 22.2268%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Change Initiated</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Event Logged</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Data Persisted</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">History Accessed</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Review &amp; Investigation=
</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>User or system triggers a profile update (e.g., role assignment=
, access change)</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>System records:</p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"019cd8f1-f635-45a4-aafc-fc96e1c7205e">Changed attributes</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"351492d5-e964-411c-9ceb-91db75e62050">Old and new values</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"c3f13bcf-8e43-4624-8e42-f64f867aa736">Actor (user/system)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"00ef2c3b-217f-49b0-93bd-169c3a6e009c">Timestamp</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"7a43772c-3679-4552-a173-d4a07f61b6d9">Source</li>
         </ul>
         <p><br></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Audit record stored immutably</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Internal user navigates to:</p>
         <ul>
