    <h2 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-FeatureUseCases"=
>Feature Use Cases&nbsp;</h2>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
