     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe expected behaviors and scenarios from multiple perspectiv=
es (client, business &amp; product, security &amp; compliance, lifecycle ma=
nagement, operational &amp; support).</p>
      <p>The use cases below describe <strong>who uses the feature and for =
what purpose</strong>, independent of how the feature is operated or suppor=
ted.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>1. Support investigation</strong></p>
    <ul>
