    <h1 id=3D"FeatureSheetChangeAuditTrail(akaUserHistory)-OpenRisks&amp;Kn=
ownGaps">Open Risks &amp; Known Gaps</h1>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe any PLANNED product gaps, constraints, operational workar=
ounds, user frictions that will not be solved but are known to cause issues=
 once launched.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><strong>Noise vs. signal</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"599f3a22-4190-495a-88f7-03188d391a89">Without careful filtering, low=E2=
=80=91value system or preference changes may clutter the history view</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Label drift</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"2c376901-57c0-4c45-ab1d-27b154bfa066">Human=E2=80=91readable labels may=
 change over time; underlying coded values must remain available for histor=
ical accuracy</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Retention limitations</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"b235978e-49ef-4ab9-a8b7-8248875dbd7d">Long=E2=80=91term regulatory need=
s beyond current retention may require future enhancement</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Cross=E2=80=91entity visibility</strong></p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"5e2885e1-6349-466f-b3bd-9eadee74f6f2">Firm=E2=80=91level changes that c=
ascade to users may not yet be fully correlated in the UI</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
